# Public site URL used for absolute Open Graph / canonical URLs in src/config/site.ts
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.infinitifitness.in

# OPTIONAL — Google Maps Embed API key for the branch maps in the Locations section.
#
# Leave this unset and the maps still work: src/lib/maps.ts falls back to the
# keyless `/maps?q=...&output=embed` endpoint, which needs no account and no
# billing. That fallback is what the demo runs on.
#
# Set it for production. The keyless endpoint is not part of Google's documented
# API and could change without notice, whereas the Embed API is versioned and
# supported, and free at any volume this site will see. Setting the variable
# switches every map over automatically — no code change.
#
# To create one: Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials ->
# Create API key, then enable "Maps Embed API" for the project. Restrict the key
# by HTTP referrer to the site's domains, since a NEXT_PUBLIC_ value is visible
# in the browser bundle by design.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
